        "path": "places[place.pirate-freeholds.opening-work-camp].vibe.approach"
      },
      "text": "The way in descends from the Border road to the hatching shed door. The yard way runs down the terraces from there. The way down leads to the landing and the barge pier. A second way out climbs the two Hist roots on the west bank.",
